{"product_id":"griezmann-mbappe-ultimate-football-heroes","title":"Griezmann \/ Mbappe (Ultimate Football Heroes)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLeading the attack for France’s golden generation is Antoine Greizmann. He has spent most of his career blazing a trail through the Spanish top division, where he has been a key player for Real Sociedad, Atlético Madrid and now Barcelona.Kylian Mbappé has the world at his feet. At the 2018 World Cup, Kylian was the star player, his goals leading France to victory in the final. Now, he has just one goal left to become the best player ever.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Matt \u0026amp; Tom Oldfield\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781787417984\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 354\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45885717905561,"sku":"12RA9781787417984","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691428b812cd5_Griezmann_Mbappe__Ultimate_Football_Heroes.jpg?v=1762965578","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/griezmann-mbappe-ultimate-football-heroes","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}